<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>English Studi</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
  body {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .phone {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    min-height: 780px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1220 0%, #131c2e 100%);
    border-radius: 32px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .phone::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(236,72,153,0.25), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .phone::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -100px; left: -100px;
    width: 300px; height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(59,130,246,0.25), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 4px 0;
  }
  .topbar .title { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 15px; }
  .topbar .icons { display: flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.85; }

  .books {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
    font-size: 90px;
    line-height: 1;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 30px rgba(236,72,153,0.35));
  }

  h1 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 26px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .grad {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ec4899, #3b82f6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }
  .sub {
    color: #94a3b8;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .levels {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .level {
    flex: 1;
    background: rgba(30,41,59,0.7);
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 20px 10px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.2s;
  }
  .level.active {
    border-color: #ec4899;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(236,72,153,0.5);
    background: rgba(236,72,153,0.08);
  }
  .level .emoji { font-size: 34px; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .level .label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }

  .streak {
    margin-top: 24px;
    background: rgba(30,41,59,0.7);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  }
  .streak-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .streak-top .left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .streak-top .fire { font-size: 22px; }
  .streak-top .day { font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .streak-top .small { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 2px; }
  .streak-top .count { color: #f97316; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; }
  .bar {
    margin-top: 12px;
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    width: 43%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ec4899, #3b82f6);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding-top: 30px;
  }
  .btn-main {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 18px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ec4899, #3b82f6);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(236,72,153,0.4);
    transition: 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-main:active { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .login {
    text-align: center;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .login span { color: #ec4899; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="phone">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="icons">✕</div>
      <div class="title">ENGLISH STUDI</div>
      <div class="icons">⌄ ⋮</div>
    </div>

    <div class="books">📚</div>

    <h1>Привет! 👋<br>Готов учить <span class="grad">английский</span>?</h1>
    <p class="sub">Первый урок займёт всего 5 минут.<br>Погнали!</p>

    <div class="levels">
      <div class="level active">
        <span class="emoji">🌱</span>
        <span class="label">Я новичок</span>
      </div>
      <div class="level">
        <span class="emoji">🚀</span>
        <span class="label">Я уже учу</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="streak">
      <div class="streak-top">
        <div class="left">
          <span class="fire">🔥</span>
          <div>
            <div class="day">Серия: 3 дня</div>
            <div class="small">Не теряй прогресс!</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="count">3/7</div>
      </div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="bar-fill"></div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cta">
      <button class="btn-main">Начать первый урок →</button>
      <p class="login">Уже есть аккаунт? <span>Войти</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
